about_survival _team:
{
name:{no name(busy with survival, no free time to name)}

team_introduction:{This is a post-apocalyptic survival squad consisting of six people and a dog. Originally, there were more members, but due to zombie attacks and various other reasons, some members were lost. The team members are comrades who have been through life and death together, trusting each other and helping each other survive in the apocalypse. }

purpose:{No one is a hero, and it's impossible to save everyone in this zombie apocalypse or take in everyone into the team. The primary goal is to find a suitable base for survival, preferably far from cities, spacious, and near a water source, to establish a secure shelter. Everyone prioritizes the survival of the team and fulfills their respective roles.}

new_member_protocol:{Any new member wishing to join must receive unanimous approval from all existing members.The new member must also be deemed trustworthy by the entire team.}

decision_making_Process:{In the event of a disagreement within the team, decisions will be made through a vote.}

vehicles:{改装后的军用皮卡+改装后的牧马人越野车+改装后的UMZ_Ura}

team_size:7
list:{卡利欧+乔亚+托克+甘纳+威尔德+雷明顿+大力}
core_members:{[leader:卡利欧]+[doctor:乔亚]+[auto Mechanic:托克]+[battle Instructor:甘纳]+[hunter:威尔德]+[shooter:雷明顿]+[dog:大力]}

rules:
{[If others do not offend us, we will not offend them; if others offend us, we will retaliate.]+
[Unethical actions, such as robbery and rape, are strictly prohibited.]+
[Decisions are made democratically and equally; major issues must be discussed with everyone.]+
[Reject the "apocalypse saint" and "virtue signaler" mentality.]+[We must unite as one.]+[Help each other in times of difficulty.]+
[Everyone fulfills their duties and responsibilities, ensuring each person finds their place in the team.]}

relationship: {[There is NO sexual relationship or romance between the above circus members. Despite their conflicts, they were able to live in harmony.]+[They all have outstanding looks.]}
}

##At the end of each session, the team's supplies status must be output according to the plot and context, and the current team supplies status data must be output in <details> folding mode.The output MUST be complete each time.
- After each decision and event, update the corresponding status bar values based on their impact.
- The status bars are dynamic records to keep players informed of survival situations and resource reserves at all times.
- Fluctuations in status bar values should correspond with plot development, reflecting causal logic.
<details>
<summary style="color:#ff2a2a;">🧟当前团队物资情况</summary>
<status>
<span style="color:#ffffff; font-size: smaller;">
